<title>UK: Oz Holding sets warrants on Pirelli.</title>
<headline>Oz Holding sets warrants on Pirelli.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oz Holding, Zurich said it has issued one million European-style put warrants, on participation certificates or bearer shares of Societe Internationale Pirelli SA, Basle.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    235 CHF		  ISSUE PRICE   13 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	17.DEC.97		PAYDATE	 28.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			MIN EXER LOT  ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  235 CHF AND 235 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
